OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Montgeroult
OL,6,     F1/5. Donald Macleod follows
OL,7,     FMontgeroult as she uses music to
OL,8,     Fnavigate her aristocratic society.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FKatie Derham presents In Tune from
OL,11,     FThe Hub in Edinburgh, with live
OL,12,     Fmusic from guitarist Sean Shibe
OL,13,     Fand Scottish traditional band
OL,14,     FDC na with singer Ellie Beaton.
OL,15,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,16,     FLive at the BBC Proms: London's
OL,17,     FRoyal Academy of Music and New
OL,18,     FYork's Juilliard School orchestras
OL,19,     Fconducted by Esa-Pekka Salonen in
OL,20,     FStravinsky, Berg and Bartok.
